              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They report taking a scheduled break on Thursday, which they initially felt was \"irresponsible\" but ultimately found beneficial."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "f379707a-beb8-4bf2-8638-224cdd584ed2"
