            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient describes walking around the block for 10 minutes, returning to work less frantic, and completing a task they had been avoiding."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "1f35738c-9ad3-4527-9a9d-8b28ebb34150"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They note that these experiences feel \"ordinary\" rather than profound.\n"
