              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "d783dfde-d456-40ab-b6b8-f57bdd8b5166"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They initially wanted to stay at their desk until everything was solved, recognizing they were holding their breath and feeling that if they stopped paying attention, something bad would happen."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "d783dfde-d456-40ab-b6b8-f57bdd8b5166"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "1fbf7a9a-e315-46c5-ac54-4a0c6d804732"
