              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "5371fcee-83b3-40db-b3e5-1d179eefb6b7"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient was able to check the evidence for this thought, noting the client had been connected with the right person and they had done what they could that day."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "0b06800e-947a-49bf-b273-66490acb276a"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They still felt worried but recognized that worrying was not the same as being needed at that exact moment.\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "13919c46-dc48-4033-9d14-aef0d5ad8913"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "08c9b672-48f8-42f9-b50d-99da745a0dac"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "5e0ead7c-0cc6-4bce-8e14-4c6cf5b67cb6"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient reports that their father's illness has contributed to their current patterns of behavior."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "08c9b672-48f8-42f9-b50d-99da745a0dac"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "5e0ead7c-0cc6-4bce-8e14-4c6cf5b67cb6"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They describe feeling that there was always one more call to make and that if they stopped paying attention, they would miss something important."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "e4af2678-3fc6-4da2-ab61-ec5a54814c11"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "4a7f40ea-f312-4b26-83db-b4e9dba4e366"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient associates their father's organization with love and felt that forgetting something meant failing him."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "8597cc33-6b38-443c-8181-b7dd74a122e3"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "5f81adf1-ddd8-47f8-9d64-f1f230a5f4dc"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They recognize that staying vigilant has become their way of proving they care about their work."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "704479ba-38ed-499c-8697-86871483cf65"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "fbea79aa-64c3-4482-ba7c-12c9ebdf239f"
