              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "ee61663b-5b26-4e83-b4b3-11c6097f96ea"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient expresses being tired of making every task feel moral and wants to believe that leaving work on time does not mean they stopped caring.\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "ec227ce3-e76d-4872-8f5c-5d7e382d3e47"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient reports that darker thoughts have not come up this week."
