            "SummarizedSegment": "Work-related stress and anxiety:\n- Continue to practice taking scheduled breaks during the workday\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "13919c46-dc48-4033-9d14-aef0d5ad8913"
