              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "- Continue to practice leaving work on time, starting with Tuesday at 6 PM\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "35233686-7220-48a5-a1ac-f840c73945d6"
              },
