              {
                "SegmentId": "4fa20b05-8574-47fb-a7d1-56751f15fee8"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "- Develop a standardized response for after-hours client communication: \"I received your message. I know this is stressful. I will review the details and call you tomorrow.\"\n"
          },
          {
